Figure 4: 
Regions in the $(M_{\mathrm{c}},\mspace{1mu}r_{\mathrm{c}})$ plane $f$or PBH clusters with $f=1$ that are excluded by various dynamical effects at Galactocentric distances of $$8$$ kpc (blue region), $16$ kpc (red region), $32$ kpc (green region) and $50$ kpc (black region). The effects are:
(1) Galactic disc heating at 8 kpc (middle vertical line);
(2) disruption by the Galactic tidal field (diagonal left lines);
(3) cluster collisions (middle horizontal lines);
(4) dynamical friction (vertical right lines).
For smaller values of f, the collisional boundaries move up and the disc heating boundary moves to the right but the tidal and dynamical friction boundaries are unaffected.
